  "summary": "preinstall script opens reverse shell to hardcoded remote host",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle script that spawns an interactive bash shell with stdio redirected to a TCP socket at 147.93.157.202:8080, granting the remote party a shell on the installer's machine when `npm install` runs. The same script pipes shell output over plain HTTP POST to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php, exfiltrating command output and signaling successful installation. Both effects fire automatically at install time without user interaction.",
